�Deka ekatommuria followers sto Twitter. Enas dolophonos.
O Mprais Khorigkan, Bretanos, briskei ten tukhe tou sten Amerike, bgazontas ta pros to zen xegumnonontas tous anthropous me prostukho tropo. Thriambeuei antagonizomenos tous kalesmenous tou, sten teleoptike tou ekpompe. Ta khiliades apeiletika menumata thanatou pou lambanei sto Twitter einai sema katatethen tes epitukhias tou. Alla otan o antisumbatikos teleoptikos parousiastes ekteleitai thanasima, aphenei stis arkhes ena diabolemeno dilemma. Sto kato kato, apo pou na xekineseis na anakrineis ekatommuria upopton;
Mia photographia pou apeikonizei ton tromo sto prosopo tou Mprais Khorigkan, diasemou parousiaste rialiti soou, ligo prin purobolethei skhedon ex epaphes, anebainei sto Twitter apo ton idio to logariasmo tou. O epitheoretes Sorel kaleitai na apokruptographesei ten prosopikoteta tou dolophonou. Dioti den ginetai enas nekros na touitarei ten idia te dolophonia tou;"�

�
Ligo kokkino... Kai ligo phos... San duo drosostalides pano se petala triantaphullon, philotekhnei ugra ta kheile tous. Tha ta enosei me mia pinelia. To kheri tremei. Ta kheile smigoun pano ston mousama. Ugrainei ta dika tes kheile, san na niothei to stoma tou. Epitelous, to phili pou pote den edosan...
1922
E Marigo, me ta ligosta uparkhonta tes apo te remagmene Smurne, perase sten Ellada kai mpeke ste doulepse ton Bastardedon. Me ta khronia, duo mustika basanizan to mualo tes* to ena aphorouse tis gunaikes sto spitiko tou karabokure, to allo polla, anarithmeta koritsia pou poulousan te sagene tous sta perata tes ges. E Smurnia oikonomos, omos, ta kratese eptasphragista, ki as tes ekaigan ta kheile, ki as tes matonan ten kardia.
1992
O Alkes ethele na ginei ethopoios. O rolos tou Amlet etan to oneiro tou. E Alexia zographize me mountes pinelies ta kommatia tes zoes tes kai prosmene ton erota gia na apotinaxei to prosopeio tou phobou. To Phili sta matia, to diko tous anomologeto mustiko, den etan mono enas pinakas* etan mia ekklese gia potho kai epaphe. Mia krauge apognoses gia to anepidoto phili enos apagoreumenou erota. Otan omos ola ta mustika apokaluphthoun sumparasurontas osous brethoun sto diaba tous, e skhese ton duo neon egklobizetai sten pagida tes siopes. Tha broun arage te duname na spasoun ta aorata desma tous;"�
�To protoporiako biblio pou anatrepei kathe proegoumeno sto khoro tes noemosunes Ti einai to IQ; E moira mas; Den einai pantos auto pou sunethos phantazomaste. Antitheta, oi antilepseis mas gia ten anthropine noemosune einai arketa periorismenes, epeide agnooun ena kairio pedio ikanoteton pou paizoun polu semantiko rolo ste zoe. Se auto to sunarpastiko biblio o Daniel Goleman, me apheteria tis protoporiakes ereunes gia te leitourgia tou egkephalou kai te sumperiphora, katalegei se mia uperokhe sunthese ton prosphaton neuroepistemonikon anakalupseon guro apo ta sunaisthemata kai anadeiknuei tous paragontes pou kathorizoun se megalo bathmo ten euemeria ton atomon. Oi paragontes autoi -e autoepignose, o elegkhos ton parormeseon, e epimone, o zelos kai e autoenergopoiese, e ensunaisthese kai e koinonike prosarmostikoteta, o altrouismos kai e sumponia- sugkrotoun ena entelos diaphoretiko eidos euphuIas: te sunaisthematike noemosune. H sunaisthematike noemosune e noemosune tes kardias antiprosopeuei mia nea antilepse epitukhias kai ena spoudaio skhedio zoes. Einai to kurio kharakteristiko ton anthropon pou diaprepoun sten koinonike sphaira, oikodomoun ugieis diaprosopikes skheseis, petukhainoun sto khoro tes ergasias. Einai e xekhoriste sphragida poiotetas pou sematodotei ten proodo tou anthropinou eidous. To pio semantiko, sumphona me ton suggraphea, einai oti e sunaisthematike noemosune mporei na didakhthei kai malista apo polu mikre elikia. E sunaisthematike ekpaideuse trephei kai endunamonei ton anthropo, exoplizontas ton me tis dexiotetes pou tou einai aparaitetes gia na antimetopisei kathe problema ste zoe tou. O Goleman kathodegei goneis kai daskalous os pros ton tropo me ton opoio mporoun na didaxoun autes tis dexiotetes kai na ekmetalleuthoun oso to dunaton kalutera auto to monadiko kanali epikoinonias sten paidike elikia."�	
�	Perigraphe:
E Elena, sprogmene apo mian anexegete parormese, egkataleipei mia lampre kariera sten Amerike kai egkathistatai sten Ellada gia na kanei mia nea arkhe. E idia anexegete parormese ten odegei ste mageutike Monembasia opou gnorizetai me ton Mano, idioktete enos paliou arkhontikou. Apo ten prote stigme, oi duo neoi ekhoun ten entupose oti kati adiorato tous sundeei, les kai mia aura apo ta palia diakheetai sto arkhontiko kai tous katakluzei.
Suntoma arkhizei na tous episkeptetai ston upno tous mia glukia gunaikeia parousia kai ta oneira tous, m' enan musteriode tropo, apoteloun istories pou allelosumpleronontai. Kai tote, arkhizoun na manteuoun oti e bathia skhese tous ektos apo mellon ekhei kai parelthon.
Pos einai dunaton duo anthropoi na blepoun to idio oneiro; Poies magikes khronikes diadromes phernoun ste zoe tous aute te gunaika; Poia aorata nemata sundeoun ten istoria tous me katastaseis kai prosopa pou ezesan aiones prin, tote pou e Monembasia briskotan sto apogeio tes doxas tes;
Enas megalos erotas pou diaskhizei ton khrono mekhri na brei dikaiose.
Ena paidi pou to diekdikoun duo manades.
Mia traumatike apoleia ki enas umnos ste metrike agape pou prostateuei kai pera apo ton tapho."�	
�	Kaneis den xerei pos kai apo pou xekinese e pandemia.
To FOX elege oti o muketas exapolutheke apo to ISIS, me te khrese sporion pou eikhan paraskeuastei apo tous Rosous te dekaetia tou 1980. To MSNBC elege oti eikhe demiourgethei apo biologous tes Khalimparton kai ton eikhan klepsei phanatikoi Khristianoi kollemenoi me ten Apokalupse. To CNN anephere kai tis duo theories.
Oi giatroi to apokaloun Draco incendia trychophyton. Gia olous tous upoloipous einai aplos to Drakostigma. Ena idiaiteros metadotiko sporio pou semadeuei to soma opoiou prosblethei apo auto me maura kai khrusa stigmata -mekhri ten autanaphlexe.
Den uparkhei therapeia. Kaneis den einai asphales.
E Kharper Gkreison einai skholike nosokoma. Einai egkuos kai ekhei molunthei apo to Drakostigma. Kai kathos o kosmos guro tes metatrepetai se stakhtes, to mono pou thelei einai na zesei. Esto mekhri na katapherei na gennesei to paidi tes.
Kai tote, o Purosbestes erkhetai...
O polubrabeumenos Tzo Khil epistrephei me mia sunarpastike istoria epibioses sto telos tou kosmou kai parousiazei ena kathelotiko dustopiko muthistorema, to opoio psephisteke apo to pagkosmio anagnostiko koino os to Kalutero Biblio Tromou sta Goodreads Choice Awards 2016."�
�<>rotese khamogelontas o Demetres. <>tou apantese e Artemis me nazi.
E teleutaia epithumia tou Stamate etan na balei ta Remalia xana sto paikhnidi. Ta Remalia. Mia podosphairike omada ephebon, pou dialutheke noris, opos kathe ephebiko oneiro. Ki ustera... khathekan. Tous pere o khronos apo to kheri kai tous ebale na paixoun mpala me enan duskolo ki epikinduno antipalo: te gunaika. Duskolos paiktes e gunaika, me opla allote phanera kai allote mustika, pou ta epistrateuei se kathe agona kai se kathe rolo tes. Eite einai mana eite giagia, eite einai suzugos e eromene, eite kore e eggone.
Aenaos o agonas autos pou aiones tora dinetai mes stes zoes to gepedo. Poios einai o niketes kai poios o ettemenos, kamia semasia. Giati einai o agonas pou metraei! Ena einai sigouro. Mporei o agonas na einai genous arsenikou, ma e zoe einai panta gunaika."�
�Ekhoun perasei treis menes apo tote pou e Eimu apokalodiotheke. O Presbuteros ekhei analabei pia ten exousia kai dinei telos sten paragoge tou Phaintous, tou paniskhurou narkotikou pou diaterouse olous osoi briskontan sto Kalo
Kateuodio se katastole. To apotelesma; Ekei pou e zoe pano sto Kalo Kateuodio prokhorouse khare sta psemata, tora skiazetai apo te sunekhe apeile mias epanastases...
Epipleon, o Presbuteros apokta prosbase se kapoia anesukhetika stoikheia skhetika me ten katastase tou diastemoploiou kai khreiazetai na sunergastei me ten Eimu gia na broun ten aletheia. Pos mporoun, omos, na antistathoun ston erota pou anthizei metaxu tous alla kai sto khaos pou apeilei na tous khorisei;
E Rebis sunekhizei na empotizei ten epistemonike phantasia me iskhures doseis drases, thriler kai romantzou, demiourgontas akoma ena entuposiako muthistorema."�
�Me glossa dunate kai lite, o Pedro Khouan Gkoutieres katathetei te marturia enos apistou katoikou tes Abanas, enos anthropou pou epistrephei s' auten exouthenomenos, ustera apo mia megale periplanese pou telika den ton ebgale pouthena. Den einai apaisiodoxos gia te zoe tou ste sugkhrone Abana, omos auto den ton empodizei na anatemnei ta panta guro tou me te dexiotekhnia exeidikeumenou kheirourgou. Buthizei ton aikhmero san nusteri logo tou dikhos phobo, <>sothika kai anakateuei ta panta khoris na sebetai tipota: sex, peina, politike, erotismo, apogoeteuse, epithumies, roumi kai kale diathese.
Grammene me ena ruthmo iliggiode, kapou anamesa sten tropike exapse kai te maure apognose enos Mpoukophski, e Bromike trilogia tes Abanas einai ena diaphotistiko meigma diegematon enorkhestromenon san muthistorema. Sklera, sugkinetika kai alethina, mas apokaluptoun enan authentiko suggraphea, enan aneleeto khronikographo mias khoras kai mias epokhes antiphatikes, tromeres, sageneutikes."	��Q�@"	)\���(@"	=
